{% comment %}
  DEVATVA.IN - PRIVACY POLICY SECTION
{% endcomment %}

<div class="page-width page-width--narrow" style="padding: 40px 20px; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; color: #292524;">
  <h1 style="font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 2.2rem; color: #1c1917; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;">
    Privacy Policy
  </h1>
  <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: #78716c; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    Last Updated: August 2026 • Devatva.in Sacred E-Commerce
  </p>

  <div style="line-height: 1.8; font-size: 1rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;">
    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; color: #b45309; margin-bottom: 8px;">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>At Devatva.in, we respect your privacy and sacred trust. When you place an order for Rudraksha, Gemstones, Yantras, or sacred idols, we collect personal information necessary to fulfill your order, including your name, delivery shipping address, phone number, email address, and payment preferences.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; color: #b45309; margin-bottom: 8px;">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use your personal data strictly to process and deliver your orders, send order tracking updates, facilitate Cash on Delivery (COD) verification, and provide customer support via our Vedic priest helpline. We do not sell or rent your personal data to third parties.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; color: #b45309; margin-bottom: 8px;">3. Data Security & Encryption</h2>
      <p>All online transactions are encrypted via industry-standard 256-bit SSL encryption. Payment gateways (UPI, GPay, PhonePe, Paytm, Cards) operate on secure PCI-DSS compliant servers.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; color: #b45309; margin-bottom: 8px;">4. Contact & Support</h2>
      <p>If you have questions regarding your data or privacy rights, please contact our Devatva support team at <strong>support@divyatva.com</strong>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

